    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d166-a1">

                <pb facs="0285" n="211" sameAs="frus:frus1866p1/pg211"/>

                <head ana="#head_untitled-missing-head-in-printed-volume">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#center">[From the Daily News <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1866-11-15">15th November,
                        1866</date>.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>A memorandum from the committee of confederate bondholders states that they are
                    actively engaged in bringing their claims to the attention of government, with a
                    view to a consideration of them, as against or in common with those of the
                    American government in relation to the Alabama and other claims.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
